{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"states\": [\n    {\n      \"shot\": 1,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他还对过去受的气不服，想到自己已经不在那些人身边，心里感到难受和空落。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"不服气、委屈、难受、想念、失落\",\n      \"missed\": \"他已经和自己争得没力气，不服气正在淡去；音乐柔和却仍有压力；旧日记忆重新变暖，眷恋中带着失落；后面还有躁动、不安，以及像深呼吸一样短暂松开却疲惫的变化。这些都需要逐句读才能发现。\",\n      \"score\": 2\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 2,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他仍放不下过去的人和事，离开之后才意识到心里的空缺，想念又让他难受。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"不服气、委屈、空落、怀念、刺痛\",\n      \"missed\": \"不服气逐渐消退、与自己争辩后的疲惫，以及柔和歌唱背后的压力、旧日记忆的温度和失落感，都藏在长段文字中。下方音符的曲线和散点变化较复杂，容易分走注意力，却没有直接帮助理解人物处境。\",\n      \"score\": 2\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 3,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他因为离开了曾经亲近的人而感到空落，仍然惦记过去，也没有完全放下当初的委屈。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"想念、失落、不甘、疲惫、压抑\",\n      \"missed\": \"他还想替自己争口气，但已经没有多少力气；回忆既有温度也有失落，后面情绪再次变得躁动不安，最后只是短暂放松，并非真正释怀。下方整齐排列的音符能让人感受到音乐的持续变化，但无法直接串起这些情绪。\",\n      \"score\": 2\n    }\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2,\n  \"link\": 2,\n  \"main_problem\": \"最影响扫读的是上半屏整段文字几乎没有内部视觉层次：人物处境、情绪变化和音乐画面全部挤在同一段、同一字号和颜色里。右上角的离开后才发现心里空了、越想念越被现实刺痛虽然简短醒目，却与大段文字相对分离。第一眼能抓到想念、失落和不服气，却不容易马上知道人物经历了什么、这些感受如何变化，以及音乐画面为什么对应这些感受。三张图的文字呈现基本相同，下面的音符动画变化没有明显改善这一问题。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "adf646b0-b8c0-4b94-bda7-b77320866cca", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T010332392252Z", "elapsed_seconds": 64.063, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:04:36.456659+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "6af29df933859d7bea5d9a9b777da902f84312015fbee67a9259c96ca686612f", "attachment_count": 3}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 3, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T010332392252Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "3ab62c35669fcc93e890e91f82910fc37402eebc41c9703a76e6d7030779188b"}}}
